     design/RimMandrake/liquid_containers_four_styles_2026-10-16.md), one ThingStyleDef per part per look, named <part>_<Look> and
     picked through the shared style picker (Machinery/PipeLook.cs), the RM_BankWeir_* pattern. Registered by
     RM_SuspensionLooks (Pits/Suspension/RM_SuspensionPatches.cs). The types share a look's art (a timber, steel and heavy deck
     in one look draw alike; the tier shows in the inspect line); the rope type keeps its own Scrapper-only art and is not
